      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/GENERATIVE-GROUNDING.md",
      "block": "**Arithmetic admission premise narrowed, 8 October 2026.** [The collective-induction study](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/ROOT-MATHEMATICAL-INDUCTION-INTEGRATION.md) proves that induction over selected predicates establishes exhaustive generation provided the selection includes the generated-orbit predicate. It separately characterizes the universal recursion role by generation and constructor separation (28 new checked theorems / 47 audits). This reduces the predicate-range requirement for that arithmetic inference, while retaining ambient natural-number iteration and the collective-domain commitment. The stronger root claim still requires independent warrant of that whole domain; a further equivalent presentation alone would not discharge it.\n\n",
