      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/MATHEMATICAL-ROOT-FRONTIER.md",
      "block": "## Collective induction and the exact arithmetic premise\n\n8 October 2026. [The checked warrant investigation](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/ROOT-MATHEMATICAL-INDUCTION-INTEGRATION.md) adds **28 Lean theorems and 47 declaration audits**. Full induction is equivalent to exhaustive generation on a supplied zero/successor carrier. The selected-predicate version needs admission of the generated-orbit predicate, not full predicate admission. Constructor separation is a distinct condition; with exhaustive generation it gives natural-number correspondence and unique recursive interpretation.\n\nThe universal recursion property is itself equivalent to generation plus separation, with the generated subtype and lifted natural numbers explicitly used as comparison targets. This is an exact characterization of the commitment, not an independent proof that its carrier exists. Lean's types, natural numbers and induction remain resources even when a theorem's printed axiom list is empty.\n\nThe affirmative argument explains induction through exhaustive possible finite formation. Independent review and a focused primary Dedekind comparison retain the further question: why are these finite forms admitted collectively, with their identities and intended quantification? The induction/initiality test is now closed at its declared scope; repeating it would not solve that first warrant. Full predicate admission, universal coverage and exclusive root constitution remain open.\n\n",
      "block_sha256": "5f90125d243da4904577a0bf6013d0ce28337f8bced1c938a0cbdde3fa149d40",
      "before_sha256": "f696c676ca20cd7698904e6135ab88e44409bacebcb07c055316be8631d50d43",
      "after_sha256": "3bd2edc7a0fb6c031c92e0b725a3d8d7342e770facfd0c6470d58cd233d2b455",
      "preserved_prior_bytes_at_write": true
